{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14103190","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14103190","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410317201:":{"text":"女王在上，赐予这些粗糙的石材——","source_cn":"女王在上，赐予这些粗糙的石材——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9655D96E9271F7DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410317202:":{"text":"又来了！整天把女王挂嘴边","source_cn":"又来了！整天把女王挂嘴边","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BE41F49740502B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410317203:":{"text":"哼，没有我们——","source_cn":"哼，没有我们——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x336D269101E7B812","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410317204:":{"text":"诶？那不是祖娅吗？","source_cn":"诶？那不是祖娅吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE04667E5DF2FCA98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410317205:":{"text":"祖娅——姑姑——！","source_cn":"祖娅——姑姑——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B1947C9215BCE2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410319001:0":{"text":"祖娅姑姑……真的是祖娅姑姑吗？","source_cn":"祖娅姑姑……真的是祖娅姑姑吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60DA3B3B6C1F320E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410319002:1":{"text":"啊，姑姑……？","source_cn":"啊，姑姑……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92B3A6C6AD04AF44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410319003:1":{"text":"姑姑！真是你！赫托在下……我简直不敢相信自己的眼睛！","source_cn":"姑姑！真是你！赫托在下……我简直不敢相信自己的眼睛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A1CF05C71DE5D95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410319004:1":{"text":"呃……你、你认错人了！","source_cn":"呃……你、你认错人了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EC04E1E0212ACAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410319005:1":{"text":"怎么会？是我啊！芬恩！小时候我偷喝你的酒，还被你狠狠打了一顿！","source_cn":"怎么会？是我啊！芬恩！小时候我偷喝你的酒，还被你狠狠打...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30AF4F8E26D9ABFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410319006:1":{"text":"赫托啊，<style=\"highlight\">你长得简直和一百年前一模一样！</style>","source_cn":"赫托啊，<style=highlight>你长得简直和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x658026E8EA7707B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410319007:1":{"text":"这么些年你去哪了？一点消息都没有！弗林什么都不肯说。","source_cn":"这么些年你去哪了？一点消息都没有！弗林什么都不肯说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x169C4B8690C4F3AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410319008:1":{"text":"说起来，你走之后，弗林就当上了村长。要我说——","source_cn":"说起来，你走之后，弗林就当上了村长。要我说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75555A3578929D3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410319009:1":{"text":"地表人！你还有闲心聊天？快干活！不要偷懒！","source_cn":"地表人！你还有闲心聊天？快干活！不要偷懒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57B34FD2ABD75611","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410319010:1":{"text":"嘿，你说谁呢？我可不是你们的仆从！放尊重点！","source_cn":"嘿，你说谁呢？我可不是你们的仆从！放尊重点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FCB0B29D5C9C57C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410319011:1":{"text":"别忘了，是你们矮人喊着求着想要深岩晶！如果不是女王开恩，你们什么都拿不到！","source_cn":"别忘了，是你们矮人喊着求着想要深岩晶！如果不是女王开恩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B2CBC82BB40116F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410319012:1":{"text":"没有我们的魔法，你们造的东西不过是堆死石头！","source_cn":"没有我们的魔法，你们造的东西不过是堆死石头！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3999C927B1FB083","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1410319013:1":{"text":"哈？！要不是我们矮人，你们这群尖耳朵怕是连个遮风挡雨的地方都没有。","source_cn":"哈？！要不是我们矮人，你们这群尖耳朵怕是连个遮风挡雨的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F6A045918ECA32C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410319014:1":{"text":"瞧瞧这些拱门和立柱，哪一块不是我们祖辈的心血？","source_cn":"瞧瞧这些拱门和立柱，哪一块不是我们祖辈的心血？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D06CA59C41E39F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410319015:1":{"text":"注意你的语气。让你们这些地表种族参与神圣工程，已是莫大的恩赐。","source_cn":"注意你的语气。让你们这些地表种族参与神圣工程，已是莫大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB512C16713134F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410319016:1":{"text":"得了吧！建神殿才是神圣工程，给你们修王城算什么神圣？","source_cn":"得了吧！建神殿才是神圣工程，给你们修王城算什么神圣？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FDECE6E8F31682D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","